    of "Diabellze the White Witch" once per turn. You can send 1 Spell/Trap from
    your hand or field to the GY; Special Summon this card from your hand. If this
    card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 "Sinful Spoils" or "Diabell"
    card from your Deck to the GY.'
